139
00:06:27,041 --> 00:06:28,166
<i>♪ In between ♪</i>

140
00:06:29,083 --> 00:06:30,791
<i>♪ What I find is pleasing ♪</i>

141
00:06:30,875 --> 00:06:32,958
<i>♪ And I'm feeling fine ♪</i>

142
00:06:33,041 --> 00:06:34,916
<i>♪ Love is so confusing ♪</i>

143
00:06:35,000 --> 00:06:37,208
<i>♪ There's no peace of mind ♪</i>

144
00:06:37,291 --> 00:06:39,541
<i>♪ If I fear I'm losing you ♪</i>

145
00:06:39,625 --> 00:06:40,916
<i>♪ It's just no good ♪</i>

146
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:43,375
<i>♪ You teasing like you do ♪</i>

147
00:06:47,125 --> 00:06:48,416
