148
00:06:52,291 --> 00:06:54,708
<i>♪ Once I had a love</i>
<i>And it was a gas ♪</i>

149
00:06:56,250 --> 00:06:59,041
<i>♪ Soon turned out</i>
<i>Had a heart of glass ♪</i>

150
00:07:00,041 --> 00:07:03,958
<i>♪ Seemed like the real thing</i>
<i>But I was so blind ♪</i>

151
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,458
<i>♪ Mucho mistrust</i>
<i>Love's gone-- ♪</i>

152
00:07:06,541 --> 00:07:08,583
-[song ends]
-[mobile phone ringing]

153
00:07:08,666 --> 00:07:11,375
[automated voice] <i>Noah calling.</i>

154
00:07:11,458 --> 00:07:12,958
-[earphone beeps]
-[panting]

155
00:07:13,041 --> 00:07:15,041
Okay, what did we forget this time?

156
00:07:15,125 --> 00:07:16,916
[caller] <i>I haven't forgotten</i>
<i>a thing, Maia.</i>

157
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,666
<i>Blessed with a perfect memory.</i>

158
00:07:21,291 --> 00:07:23,166
Who is this? Why are you on
my son's phone?

159
00:07:25,250 --> 00:07:26,666
[caller] <i>Because I have your son.</i>

160
00:07:27,250 --> 00:07:29,708
-What?
<i>-</i>[caller] <i>Here in the park.</i>

161
00:07:29,791 --> 00:07:31,541
<i>At the Temple of Venus.</i>

162
00:07:34,833 --> 00:07:36,416
Who is this?

163
00:07:36,500 --> 00:07:38,541
[caller] <i>Think of me as</i>
<i>a force for change.</i>

164
00:07:39,250 --> 00:07:41,166
<i>You're stuck in a rut.</i>

165
00:07:41,250 --> 00:07:42,916
<i>Looks like you've ordered</i>
<i>the same chicken ramen</i>

166
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:45,083
<i>every week for the last five years.</i>

167
00:07:46,333 --> 00:07:47,875
Helen, is that you?

168
00:07:47,958 --> 00:07:49,416
[caller chuckles] <i>Listen to you.</i>

169
00:07:49,500 --> 00:07:51,708
<i>Grasping for explanations.</i>

170
00:07:51,791 --> 00:07:53,416
