[whispers] Wake up, baby.

1200
01:08:13,125 --> 01:08:14,541
[sobs gently]

1201
01:08:14,625 --> 01:08:16,416
[melancholic music playing]

1202
01:08:18,916 --> 01:08:20,541
[sobbing]

1203
01:08:29,333 --> 01:08:31,250
-[Noah, weakly] Mummy.
-[gasps]

1204
01:08:32,916 --> 01:08:34,416
[Maia sobs]

1205
01:08:37,041 --> 01:08:38,500
Hey, baby.

1206
01:08:39,333 --> 01:08:41,791
-Mum, I'm thirsty.
-[sobs]

1207
01:08:47,375 --> 01:08:48,916
I'll get you anything. [inhales sharply]

1208
01:08:49,000 --> 01:08:50,666
I'll get you anything.

1209
01:08:50,750 --> 01:08:52,416
I'm so sorry.

1210
